      "content": "hey i'm planning a solo trip to london later this year and i'm a bit nervous about staying in the wrong spot lol. can u help me out? i want to see the real london, like the really vibrant and diverse neighborhoods with lots of culture, but i also wanna know which areas are a bit too sketchy or have high crime so i can avoid them. where would u recommend staying?",
