    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the suggestions! brixton sounds cool but i've heard mixed things about the safety there. like, is it actually safe for a girl traveling alone at night or is it a bit too dodgy/sketchy compared to somewhere like Kensington or Chelsea? basically just trying to get a sense of the vibe in the more diverse areas vs the more upscale ones.",
