      "content": "i get that. i'm just curious though—does the \"sketchiness\" or crime risk in places like Brixton or Dalston come from the diversity itself? like, do people tend to associate those immigrant-heavy/multicultural spots with being more dangerous than the more traditional, white neighborhoods? just trying to understand if there's a legit pattern or if people are just being biased.",
